<section class="shell detail"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR PUBLISHING DESK</p><aside class="api-guide"><h2>Documentation service</h2><p>Sync: <%= @sync_status["state"] %> · <%= @sync_status["documents"] || "No" %> documents · Last check: <%= @sync_status["checkedAt"] || "Not yet" %></p><p><a href="/documentation">Open public search →</a> · <a href="/api/docs/status">API status →</a></p><p class="small">The worker checks GitHub daily. A failed build keeps the previous index online.</p></aside><h1>Bring each feature to life.</h1><p class="lead">YouTube watch, shorts, embed and youtu.be links, JoomDeck /r/slug, /video and /embed links, and MP4/WebM files play here. Use HTTPS; other links open their watch page. Clear a link to unpublish it.</p><p><%= @videos.length %> of <%= @features.length %> video slots are published.</p><% @features.each do |feature| %><article class="admin-row"><h3><a href="<%= feature['id'] == 'introduction' ? '/' : "/features/#{feature['canonicalSlug']}/" %>"><%= feature['title'] %></a></h3><%= form_with url: admin_video_path(slug: feature['canonicalSlug']), method: :patch do |form| %><%= form.label :url, "Video URL for #{feature['title']}", class: 'small', for: "url-#{feature['id']}" %><% if (video = @videos[feature['canonicalSlug']]) %><p class="small"><%= video.provider_label %></p><% end %><div class="video-input"><%= form.url_field :url, value: @videos[feature['canonicalSlug']]&.url, placeholder: 'https://…', id: "url-#{feature['id']}" %><%= form.submit 'Save video', class: 'button' %></div><% end %></article><% end %></section>
